5:["$","p","PDF workflows also carry privacy concerns because documents may include contracts, invoices, IDs, internal screenshots, or client reports. Local-first processing and clear verification steps are central to a trustworthy PDF tool page.",{"className":"border-l-2 border-blue-200 pl-4 leading-7 text-slate-700 dark:border-blue-900 dark:text-slate-300","children":"PDF workflows also carry privacy concerns because documents may include contracts, invoices, IDs, internal screenshots, or client reports. Local-first processing and clear verification steps are central to a trustworthy PDF tool page."}]
